    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. can you expand a bit more on the specific chemical process? like, why does the solubility change so drastically when the pH shifts towards the higher end of that scale? basically just need the science behind the precipitation part so the client understands why they can't just add more fertilizer to fix it.",
